flowchart TD
    Researcher[Researcher / developer]
    Config[Experiment configuration]
    Engine[Abstract simulation engine]
    State[Simulation state]
    Metrics[Metrics and diagnostics]
    Results[Results plus provenance]
    Researcher -->|defines question and parameters| Config
    Config -->|validated input| Engine
    Engine <--> State
    Engine --> Metrics
    Metrics --> Results
    Results -->|interpret within limits| Researcher
    Tests[Automated tests] -. validates .-> Config
    Tests -. validates .-> Engine
